  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the treatment of cancer patients from Syrian refugees in Jordan (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covering the costs of treating cancer patients from Syrian refugees in Jordan as part of a comprehensive and integrated treatment plan with providing psychological care to Syrian patients</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rescue the increasing numbers of cancer patients from Syrian refugees who are unable to cover the costs of their treatment, and treat patients from Syrian refugees who are on the waiting list fully or partially.</narrative>
  </description>
